<title>FINLAND: Finnish Oct industrial production up 6.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Finnish Oct industrial production up 6.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish industrial production growth adjusted for working days accelerated to 6.8 percent year-on-year in October from 6.1 percent percent in September, Statistics Finland (SF) said on Monday in a statement.</p>
<p>		   Oct 1996   Sept 1996   Oct 1995</p>
<p>		   +6.8 pct    +6.1 pct   +1.4 pct</p>
<p>Five economists' average forecast was for a growth rate of 7.3 percent (range +6.1 - +8.0 pct).</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 235</p>
</text>
